stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> NAMED: a section needs a value the evidence does not give

    NAMED --> ROUTED: joined to exactly one family row in 20.13 with a sizing route and an owner
    NAMED --> NAMED: still an orphan at the integrity check, finding raised under C-13

    ROUTED --> IN_SIZING: the route runs - a gazette read, a portal capture, a measured cycle, a counsel opinion or an owner decision
    ROUTED --> BLOCKED: the route cannot run yet, such as no design partner or no counsel opinion

    BLOCKED --> IN_SIZING: the dependency resolves
    BLOCKED --> FENCED: the build item that needs it is fenced in 05 rather than shipped on a guess

    IN_SIZING --> SET: a value with a dated source or a recorded owner decision, counsel signed where the route is counsel
    IN_SIZING --> IN_SIZING: located but worded differently, so the engine constraint changes before the value is set

    SET --> PUBLISHED: staged publish through the 22 pipeline, two person review, golden corpus regression passed
    SET --> DARK: built and not enabled, awaiting counsel clearance

    DARK --> PUBLISHED: counsel clears it
    DARK --> WITHDRAWN: counsel declines the basis

    PUBLISHED --> SUPERSEDED: a later instrument, capture or measurement changes the value
    SUPERSEDED --> IN_SIZING: re-sized under the same route, effective dated rather than overwritten

    PUBLISHED --> ROLLED_BACK: a golden case fails after publish
    ROLLED_BACK --> IN_SIZING: cause found and the value re-derived

    FENCED --> ROUTED: the fence lifts when the route becomes runnable

    note right of SET
        A value without a dated source
        or a recorded owner decision
        fails C-14 and stops the release.
    end note

    note right of PUBLISHED
        Every ceiling, rate and slab is
        effective dated, because
        or such other amount as may be
        notified applies to almost all of them.
    end note
